Hello, this secret file is for developpers that needs pre-made debug prints.
Here are they :


---- create_move_sequence.c ----

- In move_robo_untilend loop :
```C
mini_printf("Making the move for robot %d during %d in %s\n", robot_id, id, current->name);
```

-In initialise_moving_sequence for loop after start_id :
```C
mini_printf("Moving robot %d\n", i);
mini_printf("MAX(%d, %d) > %d\n", maze->nb_robots - start_id + 1, shortest + 1, current->length + current->lower);
mini_printf("StartID = %d and path_num = %d actual path size : %d\n", start_id, path_size, current->length);
```

- In initialise_moving_sequence while loop :
```C
mini_printf("BAD : MAX(%d, %d) > %d\n", maze->nb_robots - start_id + 1, shortest + 1, current->length + current->lower);
```


---- solve_maze.c ----

- In the function find_solved_maze:
Place before
`initialise_moving_sequence(&paths, maze, get_path_currentcount(&paths, maze->nb_robots));`

This debug print:
```C
mini_printf("%d paths founds!\n", get_pathcount(&paths));
initialise_moving_sequence(&paths, maze, get_pathcount(&paths));
```


---- display_robot_moves.c ----

- You can place in the main loop of the function `display_robots_move_singlepath` :
```C
mini_printf("Id=%d ; move=%d ; path_num=%d ; room %s\n", id, rbt, abs(rbt - (id + 1)), path[abs(rbt - (id + 1))]);
```
